   In regard to +xx items:  Has anyone else besides me found items in
   the +14 range?  For example, I have found Orcish Daggers with +7
   and +14 in two different games.  I have also found (upon dying)
   a +7 Orcish Helm (black hat).

Yes, I found a +18 banded mail on level 2! And it is not a bug. I
checked the source, and the armor / weapon bonus is set by a new `rne'
function, which has NO UPPER LIMMIT. It should be possible (but
unlikely) to find armor and weapon up to +127.

While it is not a bug, it is definitely a misfeature. There should be
a upper limit, at least on the lower numbered levels.

